Derived work
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This project is a derivative of OpenCfMoto (Android), licensed AGPL-3.0:

  OpenCfMoto — Copyright (C) 2026 Alexandru <https://alexandru.rocks> and the
  OpenCfMoto contributors. https://github.com/zanderp/open-cfmoto

The PXC / EasyConnect protocol implementation, bike profiles, navigation logic,
GPX handling, trip logging and settings formats were ported from that project's
Kotlin sources and reverse-engineering documentation (OpenCfMoto 2.0.18, commit
0abbe2a). Part of the Spanish user-interface text comes from its Spanish locale.
Because it is a derived work, it is distributed under the same license
(AGPL-3.0-or-later), and anyone who redistributes it must make the complete
corresponding source available under the same terms and keep this notice.

No code from the Android Auto receiver (headunit-revived lineage) is included:
the iOS app does not implement Android Auto.

