Map data and services
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Map data © OpenStreetMap contributors, available under the Open Database License
(ODbL 1.0): https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright

The app calls these public services, each under its operator's usage policy. For
heavy use, set your own tile server or an openrouteservice key in Settings.

  * Map tiles: tile.openstreetmap.org (OpenStreetMap Foundation), the default
    tile server, which you can change in Settings.
  * Place search: Photon (photon.komoot.io, by komoot), with Nominatim
    (nominatim.openstreetmap.org, OpenStreetMap Foundation) as the fallback.
  * Nearby places and speed limits: Overpass API (overpass-api.de, FOSSGIS e.V.).
  * Routing: Valhalla (valhalla1.openstreetmap.de, FOSSGIS e.V.) and OSRM
    (router.project-osrm.org, the Project OSRM demo server). With your own key:
    openrouteservice (api.openrouteservice.org), © openrouteservice.org by
    HeiGIT | Map data © OpenStreetMap contributors.
